g `green-verify` and `verify-all` gates.\"]},\"openQuestions\":[],\"specDeviations\":[\"PlatformStore still owns part of the review/package composition surface through `listProcessReviewTargets` and `getProcessReviewPackage` instead of the fully narrowed durable-facts-only boundary described in the Epic 5 server tech design.\"],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"Return this story to verification and have the verifier re-check SV-05-001 against the new stale package-member fallback behavior.\"}"}}
